# Wave W17-K (Lastlight Pass): memorial stone — a tall memorial cairn of the Conference road, three grey tiers under a flat worn cap slab, standing on pass turf (fully opaque, ground baked in). The design names the memorial stones at the bends: every stone here has been walked by a finalist.
